<title>INDIA: FORECAST-India 364-day t-bill yield seen up yr-end.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-India 364-day t-bill yield seen up yr-end.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yield on the 364-day treasury bill auction held by the Reserve Bank of India is seen rising to 11.19 percent by the end of the year from the currrent 10.35 percent, a Reuters poll of 23 banks and companies on Friday found.  </p>
<p>--</p>
